{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for coaching, intensives, and practical habit guidance.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe6; /* warm parchment */
      --ink:#2e2a25;
      --accent:#9b6b3a; /* clay */
      --muted:#7d6a59;
      --card:#fff7f0;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px;
      --shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(46,42,37,0.08);
      --maxW:980px;
      --focus: 3px solid rgba(155,107,58,0.18);
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;line-height:1.45;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(155,107,58,0.06),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxW);margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#c68a5a);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--card);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav-links a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:var(--ink)}
    .primary-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none}

    main{padding:36px 0}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.85));padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .lead{font-size:20px;color:var(--muted)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:28px}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;margin-top:20px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.06);background:#fff}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.06);color:var(--ink)}

    .tools{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .tool{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.8),#fff)}
    .tool h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Habit builder list */
    .habit-days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
    .day{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.04)}
    .printable{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff0e8);}

    /* Modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(14,12,10,0.36);display:none;place-items:center;z-index:60}
    .modal{width:min(720px,96vw);background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(34,28,22,0.5);}
    .modal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .modal-body{margin-top:12px}
    .exercise-visual{height:160px;display:grid;place-items:center}
    .breath-circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(155,107,58,0.14),rgba(155,107,58,0.06));display:grid;place-items:center;transition:transform 1s ease}

    footer{margin-top:32px;padding:28px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* print rules */
    @media print{
      body *{visibility:hidden}
      .printable, .printable *{visibility:visible}
      .printable{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%}
    }

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav-links{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="logo">W</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="programs.html">Journeys</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
          <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
          <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
          <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:700">Connect</a>
        </div>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero panel">
      <div class="meta">Contact • Practical strategies for steady rhythms • Quick clarity session available</div>
      <h1>Reach out to begin a focused intake</h1>
      <div class="lead">Use this page to ask a question, book an introductory conversation, or try a short guided practice right now. No medical advice—only frameworks, habits, and stepwise outcomes.</div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Get in touch</h2>
          <p class="small">Prefer a quick note? Share a few details and I’ll get back within 48 hours. For urgent scheduling, call {{PHONE}}.</p>
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();submitContact();">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

            <label for="interest">Are you interested in</label>
            <select id="interest">
              <option>Short intensive (focused & practical)</option>
              <option>Multi-week program</option>
              <option>Habit design and accountability</option>
              <option>One-off consulting session</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="Briefly describe what you'd like support with"></textarea>

            <div class="row">
              <button type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" onclick="location.href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'">Email {{EMAIL}}</button>
            </div>
            <div id="contactStatus" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px"></div>
          </form>

          <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.04)">

          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Try a quick practice</h3>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <button onclick="openExercise('breathing')">Breathing</button>
            <button onclick="openExercise('journaling')">Journaling</button>
            <button onclick="openExercise('intention')">Intention Setting</button>
            <button onclick="startMiniChallenge()" class="secondary">7-Day Habit Challenge</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3>How I respond</h3>
          <p class="small">I aim to reply within 48 hours. If you’re booking, include a few times that work and your time zone. Phone: {{PHONE}} • Email: {{EMAIL}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="tools">
          <div class="tool">
            <h3>Habit builder</h3>
            <div class="small">Create a printable 7-day checklist for any habit. Tweak intensity and print or save for your planner.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="habitName">Habit</label>
              <input id="habitName" placeholder="e.g., Morning movement, 10-min journaling">
              <label for="intensity">Intensity</label>
              <select id="intensity">
                <option value="gentle">Gentle — 10–15 minutes</option>
                <option value="steady">Steady — 15–25 minutes</option>
                <option value="bold">Bold — 25–40 minutes</option>
              </select>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
                <button onclick="generateChallenge()">Generate checklist</button>
                <button onclick="printChecklist()" class="secondary">Print checklist</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tool">
            <h3>Need proof?</h3>
            <div class="small">Client stories and condensed notes are available on the Stories and Journeys pages. A short intake helps us pick the right path.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Available: short intensives, multi-week journeys, and focused habit support.</div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3>Quick details</h3>
          <div class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a><br>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <div id="printArea" class="printable" style="display:none;margin-top:18px;border:1px dashed rgba(46,42,37,0.06)"></div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Crafted with simple, repeatable practices • <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal for guided exercises -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal-backdrop" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <strong id="modalTitle">Exercise</strong>
        <div>
          <button id="modalClose" onclick="closeModal()" aria-label="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div id="modalContent">
          <!-- dynamic content inserted here -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // basic helpers
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    function submitContact(){
      var name = document.getElementById('name').value;
      var email = document.getElementById('email').value;
      var message = document.getElementById('message').value;
      var status = document.getElementById('contactStatus');
      status.textContent = 'Sending...';
      // simulated send
      setTimeout(function(){
        status.textContent = 'Thanks, '+(name||'there')+" — I'll reply to " + email + ' within 48 hours.';
      },800);
    }

    // Habit builder: create 7-day checklist
    function generateChallenge(){
      var name = document.getElementById('habitName').value.trim();
      if(!name){alert('Please add a habit name.');return}
      var intensity = document.getElementById('intensity').value;
      var minutes = {gentle:10,steady:20,bold:30}[intensity] || 15;

      var header = '<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">7-Day Habit Checklist</h2>';
      header += '<div style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Habit: '+escapeHtml(name)+' • Daily target: approx '+minutes+' min</div>';

      var list = '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px">';
      var today = new Date();
      for(var i=0;i<7;i++){
        var d = new Date(); d.setDate(today.getDate()+i);
        var label = d.toLocaleDateString(undefined,{weekday:'short',month:'short',day:'numeric'});
        list += '<div style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.04)">'
              +'<div style="font-weight:600">Day '+(i+1)+' • '+label+'</div>'
              +'<div><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Day '+(i+1)+' complete"></div>'
              +'</div>';
      }
      list += '</div>';

      var notes = '<div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Notes: Use this checklist to track 7 consecutive days. Adjust the daily time and anchor to an existing cue (after coffee, before work, after dinner).</div>';

      var printButton = '<div style="margin-top:12px"><button onclick="printChecklist()">Print this checklist</button></div>';

      var html = header + list + notes + printButton;
      var target = document.getElementById('printArea');
      target.innerHTML = html;
      target.style.display = 'block';
      target.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
    }

    function printChecklist(){
      var target = document.getElementById('printArea');
      if(target.innerHTML.trim()===''){alert('Generate a checklist first.');return}
      window.print();
    }

    function escapeHtml(s){
      return (s||'').replace(/[&<>\"']/g,function(c){return{'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',"'":"&#39;"}[c]});
    }

    // Mini challenge quick starter
    function startMiniChallenge(){
      var habit = prompt('What single habit would you like to try for 7 days? (e.g., 10-min walk, 5-min journaling)');
      if(!habit) return;
      document.getElementById('habitName').value = habit;
      document.getElementById('intensity').value = 'gentle';
      generateChallenge();
    }

    // Guided exercises modal controller
    var modal = document.getElementById('modal');
    var modalContent = document.getElementById('modalContent');
    var exerciseTimer = null;

    function openExercise(type){
      modal.style.display = 'grid';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      buildExercise(type);
      document.getElementById('modalClose').focus();
      document.addEventListener('keydown', handleModalKey);
    }
    function closeModal(){
      modal.style.display = 'none';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
      modalContent.innerHTML = '';
      if(exerciseTimer) clearInterval(exerciseTimer);
      document.removeEventListener('keydown', handleModalKey);
    }
    function handleModalKey(e){ if(e.key==='Escape') closeModal(); }

    function buildExercise(type){
      var title = {breathing:'Breathing Practice',journaling:'Timed Journaling',intention:'Intention Setting'}[type]||'Practice';
      document.getElementById('modalTitle').textContent = title;
      if(type==='breathing') buildBreathing();
      if(type==='journaling') buildJournaling();
      if(type==='intention') buildIntention();
    }

    // Breathing: cycle with visual circle
    function buildBreathing(){
      modalContent.innerHTML = '';
      var el = document.createElement('div');
      el.innerHTML = '<div class="exercise-visual"><div id="breathCircle" class="breath-circle"></div></div>'+
                     '<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><div id="breathPhase" style="font-weight:700"></div><div id="breathCountdown" style="color:var(--muted)"></div></div>'+
                     '<div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px"><button id="breathStart">Start 3 cycles</button><button class="secondary" id="breathStop">Stop</button></div>';
      modalContent.appendChild(el);

      var cycle = 0, phase='inhale', remaining=4, maxCycles=3;
      var circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
      var phaseLabel = document.getElementById('breathPhase');
      var countdown = document.getElementById('breathCountdown');

      function updateUI(){
        phaseLabel.textContent = phase.toUpperCase();
        countdown.textContent = remaining + 's';
        if(phase==='inhale') circle.style.transform = 'scale(1.12)';
        else if(phase==='hold') circle.style.transform = 'scale(0.98)';
        else circle.style.transform = 'scale(0.7)';
      }
      function step(){
        if(remaining>0){ remaining--; updateUI(); return }
        if(phase==='inhale'){ phase='hold'; remaining=3 }
        else if(phase==='hold'){ phase='exhale'; remaining=6 }
        else { // exhale ended
          cycle++; if(cycle>=maxCycles){ stop(); phase='done'; remaining=0; updateUI(); return }
          phase='inhale'; remaining=4;
        }
        updateUI();
      }
      function start(){ if(exerciseTimer) clearInterval(exerciseTimer); cycle=0; phase='inhale'; remaining=4; updateUI(); exerciseTimer = setInterval(step,1000); }
      function stop(){ if(exerciseTimer) clearInterval(exerciseTimer); exerciseTimer=null; }

      document.getElementById('breathStart').onclick = start;
      document.getElementById('breathStop').onclick = function(){ stop(); phase='paused'; remaining=0; updateUI(); };
      updateUI();
    }

    // Journaling: prompt + timer + quick export
    function buildJournaling(){
      modalContent.innerHTML = '';
      var el = document.createElement('div');
      var prompts = [
        'What is one small shift that would make today better?',
        'Describe a moment recently when you felt steady — what helped?',
        'Name three things you can do this week to support your energy.'
      ];
      var p = prompts[Math.floor(Math.random()*prompts.length)];
      el.innerHTML = '<div style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px">Prompt</div><div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px">'+escapeHtml(p)+'</div>'+
                     '<textarea id="journalText" placeholder="Write freely for the next few minutes..."></textarea>'+
                     '<div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">'+
                     '<label for="journalMin" class="small">Minutes</label><select id="journalMin"><option>3</option><option selected>5</option><option>10</option></select>'+
                     '<button id="journalStart">Start timer</button><button class="secondary" id="journalExport">Save text</button></div>'+
                     '<div id="journalTimer" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"></div>';
      modalContent.appendChild(el);

      var timerId=null, remaining=0;
      document.getElementById('journalStart').onclick = function(){
        if(timerId) { clearInterval(timerId); timerId=null; document.getElementById('journalTimer').textContent='Stopped.'; return }
        remaining = parseInt(document.getElementById('journalMin').value)*60;
        document.getElementById('journalTimer').textContent = formatTime(remaining);
        timerId = setInterval(function(){ remaining--; document.getElementById('journalTimer').textContent = formatTime(remaining); if(remaining<=0){ clearInterval(timerId); timerId=null; document.getElementById('journalTimer').textContent='Time!'; }},1000);
      };
      document.getElementById('journalExport').onclick = function(){
        var txt = document.getElementById('journalText').value.trim();
        if(!txt){ alert('Nothing written yet.'); return }
        // quick download
        var blob = new Blob([txt],{type:'text/plain'});
        var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob); a.download='journal.txt'; a.click();
      };
      function formatTime(s){ var m=Math.floor(s/60); var r=s%60; return m+':'+(r<10?'0'+r:r); }
    }

    // Intention setting: stepwise prompts
    function buildIntention(){
      modalContent.innerHTML = '';
      var el = document.createElement('div');
      el.innerHTML = '<div style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px">A brief framework to set an intention</div>'+
                     '<ol style="padding-left:18px"><li style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>Name the feeling</strong> — how do you want to move through the day?</li><li style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>Choose one action</strong> — tiny and specific (e.g., 10 deep breaths, 1-minute stretch)</li><li style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>Anchor it</strong> — when will you do it?</li></ol>'+
                     '<div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><input id="intendText" placeholder="My intention — e.g., Move gently after lunch" style="flex:1"><button id="intendSave">Save</button></div>'+
                     '<div id="intendSaved" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"></div>';
      modalContent.appendChild(el);
      document.getElementById('intendSave').onclick = function(){
        var txt = document.getElementById('intendText').value.trim();
        if(!txt){ alert('Write a short intention.');return }
        document.getElementById('intendSaved').textContent = 'Saved: ' + txt + ' — try to link it to a daily cue.';
      }
    }

    // small accessibility: trap focus inside modal when open
    document.addEventListener('focusin', function(e){
      if(modal.style.display==='grid' && !modal.contains(e.target)){
        e.stopPropagation(); document.getElementById('modalClose').focus();
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the wellness_coach site (chunk 4)

Files included:
- contact.html — complete contact page with interactive habit builder and guided-practice modals.

Placeholders to replace in your deployment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — business or coach name
- {{TAGLINE}} — (not used on this page but part of site placeholders)
- {{PHONE}} — phone number
- {{EMAIL}} — email address
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — label for the primary CTA in the header
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — URL for the primary CTA
- {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — location hints

Primary features implemented here:
- Contact form (simulated send). The form does not post to a server—replace submitContact() with your integration (email API, CRM, or form backend).
- Habit builder: a simple 7-day challenge generator. Enter a habit and intensity, click "Generate checklist" to populate a printable checklist in the page. Use the Print button or your browser print function. The printable area is scoped to the checklist via CSS @media print rules.
- "Try it now" guided exercises: a modal with three practices implemented in pure JS:
  - Breathing: visual circle + inhale/hold/exhale cycles. Start/stop controls included.
  - Journaling: random prompt, configurable timer (3/5/10 minutes), export journal text as .txt.
  - Intention setting: short stepwise prompts and a quick save confirmation.

Accessibility & behaviors:
- Modal supports Escape to close and basic focus management.
- Print styles limit printed output to the checklist area.

Styling and assets:
- The page uses a warm, earthy palette and self-contained CSS (no external fonts or CDNs).
- The design expects an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg elsewhere in the project for global backgrounds; this page does not rely on external images directly.

Integration notes:
- Replace placeholder strings before publishing.
- Hook the contact form to your preferred backend where submitContact() currently simulates a send.
- The habit checklist is client-side only. If you want to store generated checklists per user, extend generateChallenge() to POST the data to your server.

Testing:
- Open contact.html in a modern browser.
- Try the habit builder: enter a habit, choose intensity, Generate checklist, then Print.
- Click any "Try" button (Breathing, Journaling, Intention) to open the modal and interact.

Developer hints:
- The guided exercises are intentionally minimal and extendable. Timers use setInterval for clarity; switch to requestAnimationFrame for smoother animations if needed.
- When adding analytics or form endpoints, avoid including sensitive personal data in client-side logs.

Design choices & compliance:
- Copy and structure avoid the recent signature tokens and emphasize outcomes, habits, and frameworks (no medical claims).
- Navigation uses alternative labels but links point to the correct site pages (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html).

If you need the SVG pattern (assets/img/pattern.svg) produced in this chunk, request the asset in the next iteration. This chunk intentionally includes only contact.html and README.md."}
